{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/names/en","Scarlita"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名庄重的战士，能够在关键时刻降临战场，携手友军扭转战局。"],["/description_i18n/en","A solemn Warrior who excels at turning the tides in crucial moments and ensuring victory with allies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我在这里。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Here I am."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谦虚是美德之母。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Modesty is the mother of virtue."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","接受惩罚吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Face your punishment."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","一切尚未结束……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","It's not... yet... over..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","这是必然的结果。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","This was the inevitable result."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我将心怀怜悯，浴血奋战。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Mercy guides me as I fight with valor."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","光明从未远去，裁决终将降临。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","In the unyielding light, judgement's arrival is imminent."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","向着裁决的斧刃，说出你的罪孽吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Confess your sins to the axe of judgement."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","正义从不离去。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Justice never departs."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","stt"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","神的光辉……终于让我再次感受到了。请庇佑伊索米亚。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I finally feel the radiance of the divine once more. Please safeguard Esperia."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是何物？赠礼？那是什么意思？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","What is this? A gift? What does it signify?"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","如此邪恶之物，由我清除。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","I shall purge such wickedness."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在这里做什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What's happening here?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","无法理解……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I can't wrap my head around this..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我要给齿轮上油"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I need to oil the gears."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","增加了灯光"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The lights have been added."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","在这里做什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/en","What's happening here?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日礼物？那是什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Holiday gifts? What are those?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","陈设很用心"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Such thoughtful touches everywhere."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","晚上要按时休息"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Tonight, I'll actually rest on time."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德一直无法理解为什么会有人会向她许愿，就像她也无法理解那些许愿者的愿望一样。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Scarlita never quite grasps why folks make wishes to her; understanding their wishes is equally puzzling to her."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德偶尔也会满足他人的愿望——用一些物理的、单刀直入的、干脆利索的、一了百了的方式。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","On rare occasions, Scarlita grants wishes in more direct, physical ways."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","听说斯克嘉莉德尤为钟爱柑橘香气的武器保养油。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","They say Scarlita favors citrus-scented weapon maintenance oil."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","许多战士认为斯克嘉莉德能带领他们获得胜利，而许多矮人工匠认为她能保佑他们的新发明不出问题。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Many fighters believe Scarlita can lead them to victory, while quite a few dwarf craftsmen rely on her to keep their new inventions and weapons from falling apart."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","作为神明手中的武器，斯克嘉莉德很难理解正常生灵的需求：比如饮食、睡眠或者所谓的爱情。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","As a divine weapon, Scarlita finds the needs of ordinary creatures, from eating to sleeping to so-called love, hard to comprehend."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","对于世界上的大多数事，斯克嘉莉德都并不会厌恶或者喜爱，她一般只是“无感”。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Most things in this world don't elicit any feelings from Scarlita."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","比起制定战术，斯克嘉莉德更喜欢听从命令和指示。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Scarlita would rather follow orders than develop tactics."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德最喜欢的小玩意是音乐盒——虽然很难得知她喜欢的究竟是美妙的音乐，还是盒内精巧的发条和齿轮。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Scarlita's favorite toy is a music box; it's unclear if she enjoys the music or the intricate springs and gears inside."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德是会笑的，大概，也许，遥远的某个过去，在某次击败了恶魔大军后，曾经有人见到过她的一丝笑容。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Once upon a time, Scarlita used to smile. Witnesses caught a brief smile on her face after a glorious victory over the Hypogean army."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德不太喜欢布料，她现在的衣服完全是为了给自己的金属躯体防尘而准备的。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Scarlita actually doesn't like clothing. Any fabric she is wearing now was designed to keep dust and debris from entering her body."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","好无聊啊，既然之前的事情告一段落，我们来一场宴会庆祝下如何？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","I'm bored. Since everything's fine now, how about we celebrate with a party?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415014.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415014.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","……如上所述，进食既非必要，又是浪费时间的举动。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","...As mentioned above, eating is both unnecessary and a waste of time."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Scarlita & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","在这里做什么？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","What's happening here?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415144.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415144.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","我要给齿轮上油"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","I need to oil the gears."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415145.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415145.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","增加了灯光"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","The lights have been added."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415461.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415461.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","节日礼物？那是什么？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Holiday gifts? What are those?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415462.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415462.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我在这间屋内见到了恶魔，应当立刻执行裁决！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","A Hypogean lurks in this room. It's time to carry out judgment without delay!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415488.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415488.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿塔利娅 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Athalia & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","陈设很用心"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Such thoughtful touches everywhere."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415639.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415639.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","晚上要按时休息"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Tonight, I'll actually rest on time."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415640.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415640.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","唔，身上粘了好多泥巴……漫漫想洗澡了。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Ugh, I got so much mud on me... I think I'll take a bath."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414070.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414070.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德，你注意到了吗？"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Scarlita, are you paying attention?"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414140.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414140.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Scarlita"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","我曾经，有个朋友。"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","I once had a friend."],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414150.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414150.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","斯克嘉莉德 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Scarlita & Dionel"]]}